Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] Resample original PC title logo from runtime sprites

Keep the original title sprites and their animation while they enter. On the
stable title state, upload the original US sprites into a private RGBA texture,
resample the logo with the PC-only Lanczos2 path, and hide only the duplicate
native logo/footer/menu draws. Switch and SDL3 GL retain their original path.

